{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 88,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0714416503906,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "The definition has resource implications. One observational study from PNG",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.1203918457031,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "reports on the prevalence of hypoxaemia when it is defined at varying levels of SpO .",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        391.4588928222656,
        80.0282211303711,
        394.3388977050781,
        88.12222290039062
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.1090393066406,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Thirteen percent of children were hypoxaemic using a definition of SpO  < 85%; 26%",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        345.64910888671875,
        93.0282211303711,
        348.52911376953125,
        101.12222290039062
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        305.369384765625,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "using SpO  < 90% and 44% using SpO  < 93% [Laman, 2005].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        98.5802001953125,
        106.0282211303711,
        213.11940002441406,
        114.12222290039062
      ],
      "text": "2 2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        123.26070404052734,
        163.95286560058594,
        135.25070190429688
      ],
      "text": "10.4.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        138.90542602539062,
        88.77290344238281,
        151.04542541503906
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        151.91542053222656,
        399.0827941894531,
        165.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "Oxygen reduces pneumonia mortality in children with hypoxaemia. Pulse oximetry",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        164.91539001464844,
        399.06304931640625,
        178.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "is the most reliable method of detecting hypoxaemia. Having clear and simple",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        177.91539001464844,
        399.06280517578125,
        191.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "guidelines that health workers can follow is necessary for the timely detection and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.91539001464844,
        160.9028778076172,
        204.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "treatment of hypoxaemia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        203.91539001464844,
        399.0765686035156,
        217.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Recommending a cut-off SpO  of 90% and a lower level (85–87%) at high altitudes",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        187.77670288085938,
        211.20130920410156,
        190.65670776367188,
        219.29531860351562
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        216.91539001464844,
        183.83291625976562,
        230.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "to indicate the need for oxygen:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        235.58470153808594,
        188.02183532714844,
        249.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "prevents over-hospitalization",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        237.8111572265625,
        63.541900634765625,
        246.81114196777344
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        248.58470153808594,
        301.331787109375,
        262.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "conserves oxygen in settings where it is a limited resource",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        250.8111572265625,
        63.541900634765625,
        259.8111572265625
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        270.07861328125,
        78.65290069580078,
        282.2185974121094
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        283.0885925292969,
        399.0528869628906,
        296.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "Oxygen being combustible, fire hazard and tank explosion is always there. Catheters",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        296.0885925292969,
        399.0727233886719,
        309.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "and masks used to administer oxygen may cause injury to the nose and mouth while",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        309.0885925292969,
        399.0628967285156,
        322.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "dry and non-humidified gas can cause dryness and crusting. Hypoventilation can",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        322.0885925292969,
        399.0661926269531,
        335.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "lead to hypercapnia and CO  narcosis although the risk is small with low flow oxygen",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        168.79640197753906,
        329.3746032714844,
        171.67640686035156,
        337.4685974121094
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        335.0885925292969,
        91.64288330078125,
        348.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "therapy.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        359.6072082519531,
        205.31298828125,
        371.5971984863281
      ],
      "text": "10.4.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        375.26177978515625,
        399.0328369140625,
        388.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "Value was placed on having clear and simple guidelines for oxygen therapy to address",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        388.26177978515625,
        399.0525817871094,
        401.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "the large global burden of hypoxaemia. Pulse oximetry is the best method of detecting",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        401.26177978515625,
        399.05279541015625,
        414.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "the presence or absence of hypoxaemia. The technology is affordable (oximeters",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        414.26177978515625,
        399.1127624511719,
        427.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "range from US$ 35 for handheld devices to US$ 4500 for more sophisticated models).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        427.26177978515625,
        399.04296875,
        440.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "Studies from Malawi [Enarson, 2009] and PNG [Duke, 2008] have shown that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        440.26177978515625,
        399.1027526855469,
        453.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "it is feasible to train health workers in criteria for initiating oxygen therapy using",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        453.26177978515625,
        183.2711944580078,
        466.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "recommended cut-offs of SpO .",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.8795928955078,
        460.5478210449219,
        180.7595977783203,
        468.6418151855469
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        477.7804260253906,
        227.33291625976562,
        489.7704162597656
      ],
      "text": "10.5\t Oxygen therapy delivery methods",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        493.43499755859375,
        399.1329345703125,
        506.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Nasal prongs are the preferred method for delivering oxygen in infants and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        506.43499755859375,
        384.0914001464844,
        519.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "children under five years of age with hypoxaemia who require oxygen therapy.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        521.8396606445312,
        277.7628173828125,
        535.7596435546875
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        538.1043701171875,
        399.0529479980469,
        551.5943603515625
      ],
      "text": "b)\tWhere nasal prongs are not available, nasal or nasopharyngeal catheters could",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        551.1043701171875,
        399.0514831542969,
        564.5943603515625
      ],
      "text": "be used as alternative delivery methods. Face masks or head-boxes are not",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        564.1043701171875,
        128.89151000976562,
        577.5943603515625
      ],
      "text": "recommended.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        579.5089721679688,
        277.7628173828125,
        593.428955078125
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        595.7735595703125,
        399.0228576660156,
        609.2635498046875
      ],
      "text": "The panel noted that the use of face masks or head-boxes is not recommended as the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        608.7735595703125,
        399.06280517578125,
        622.2635498046875
      ],
      "text": "preferred method because it requires higher flow rates leading to oxygen wastage.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.75390625,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.2869110107422,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "74",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}